{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106414","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106414","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1410641401:0":{"text":"리프 크리스탈이 대체 어딜 가려는 거지? 이쪽은 신전으로 가는 길이 아닌 것 같은데.","source_cn":"织叶到底想去哪？这边好像不是去神殿建筑地的路啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D01EDA754092127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410641402:1":{"text":"페리엘에게서 이야기 못 들으셨습니까? 저희 선조님을 인도해 셀로클랜드를 발견한 것은 바로 리프 크리스탈이었습니다.","source_cn":"你没听斐利尔提起过吗？织叶曾经引领我们的祖先找到了萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44B1BC0C235712C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410641403:0":{"text":"어쩌면 이 리프 크리스탈의 소임은 길 잃은 자를 안내하는 것일지도 모르겠군요.","source_cn":"我想，也许它的职责便是在有人迷茫时给出指引。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE1D5CA001E29E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410641404:1":{"text":"아니, 어쩌면 이번엔 페리엘이 리프 크리스탈을 통해 저희를 인도하는 것일 수도 있겠군요... 어쨌든, 따라가 보시죠.","source_cn":"又或许，这一次是斐利尔在通过织叶指引我们……总之先跟上吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB26E70CF8DB1F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}